OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with high cloud
OL,7,Fand some clearer skies giving some
OL,8,Fhazy evening sunshine. Winds becoming
OL,9,Flight but remaining breezy along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Fthrough the morning, mostly clearing
OL,14,Fby mid-afternoon. Blustery winds
OL,15,Fdeveloping by late-morning. Very warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
